+# Production Documentation Index
+
+Start here for production-oriented use:
+
+- `PRODUCTION_READY_DOCUMENTATION.md` — architecture, qualification rules, production blockers.
+- `OPERATOR_GUIDE.md` — safe bench/production operator procedure.
+- `RELEASE_PROCESS.md` — release candidate and production release workflow.
+- `VALIDATION_MATRIX.md` — authoritative qualification status and required evidence.
+- `ADC_CALIBRATION.md` — RP2040 measurement calibration and acceptance procedure.
+- `SAFETY_MEDICAL_GRADE_REVIEW.md` — hazard/safety review and medical-use boundary.
+- `SUPPORT_MATRIX.md` — feature implementation/support overview.
+- `USB_PROTOCOL.md` — DJP2 protocol definition.
+- `DEBUGGING.md` — debug architecture and host integration.
+- `CLEANROOM.md` — clean-room implementation boundary.
+
+Production claims must follow `VALIDATION_MATRIX.md`, not README marketing text or source-code presence alone.
